# Interactive transactional direct vertical-state gate.
# Run with: IC research/pybada-envelope-vertical-direct
00:00:00.00>ECHO TEST INFO === PYBADATEM DIRECT VERTICAL STATE GATE ===
00:00:00.10>ECHO TEST INFO This gate applies the same excessive VS through transactional MOVE commands.
00:00:00.15>ECHO TEST INFO MOVE vertical speed is feet per minute. 10000 fpm equals 50.80 m/s.
00:00:00.20>PLUGIN LOAD PYBADATEM
00:00:00.30>PLUGIN LOAD RESEARCHRECORDER
00:00:00.40>PERFMODEL BADA4
00:00:01.00>CRE VMR,A320-232,41.30,2.10,90,FL200,250
00:00:01.10>CRE VME,A320-232,41.32,2.10,90,FL200,250
00:00:01.20>DYNAMICS VMR KINEMATIC
00:00:01.30>DYNAMICS VME KINEMATIC
00:00:01.40>VS VMR 500
00:00:01.50>VS VME 500
00:00:02.00>ENVELOPECHECKS VMR CUSTOM ROC_MAX
00:00:02.10>ENVELOPECHECKS VME CUSTOM ROC_MAX
00:00:02.20>ENVELOPE VMR REPORT
00:00:02.30>ENVELOPE VME ENFORCE
00:00:02.40>RECORDRESEARCH INTERVAL 0.1
00:00:03.00>RECORDRESEARCH START pybada-envelope-vertical-direct.csv
00:00:03.10>ECHO TEST EXPECT VMR REPORT should accept the next MOVE and emit ACCEPTED ROC_MAX.
00:00:04.00>MOVE VMR,41.50,2.50,FL200,90,250,10000
00:00:04.10>ECHO TEST EXPECT VME ENFORCE should reject the next MOVE, name VME, and preserve its prior VS.
00:00:04.20>MOVE VME,41.52,2.50,FL200,90,250,10000
00:00:05.00>ECHO TEST EXPECT VMR REPORT INFEASIBLE and VME ENFORCE VALID.
00:00:05.10>PERFSTATUS VMR
00:00:05.20>PERFSTATUS VME
00:00:06.00>RECORDRESEARCH STOP
00:00:06.10>ECHO TEST INFO Run the vertical validator with --direct.
00:00:07.00>HOLD
